    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Score composition, tiers & identity",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Score composition (max **1000**)\n| Sub-score | Cap | Earned from |\n|---|---|---|\n| Identity | 530 | verification + linked socials |\n| Content | 350 | verified, correctly-labeled work |\n| Longevity | 70 | sustained good standing over time |\n| Reputation | 50 | dispute & jury track record |\n\nA new verified identity starts at **500**.\n\n### Trust tiers\n| Tier | Range |\n|---|---|\n| Highly Trusted | 850 \u2013 1000 |\n| Trusted | 650 \u2013 849 |\n| Verified | 400 \u2013 649 |\n| Caution | 200 \u2013 399 |\n| Not Trusted | 0 \u2013 199 |\n\n### Identity & social linking\n**+5** per verified linked social, up to **6** accounts (cap **+30**)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Penalties",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
